OL,3,GNEWSANew charity uses outdoors to
OL,4,Aimprove mental health
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new charity hopes to use activities
OL,7,Franging from cold-water swimming and
OL,8,Farchery to hill walking and breathwork
OL,9,Fto improve men's mental health and
OL,10,Freduce isolation.
OL,12,FConnect Outdoors is being officially
OL,13,Flaunched alongside an International
OL,14,FMen's Day event at the Venture Centre
OL,15,Fin Maughold, where organisers expect
OL,16,Fabout 80 people to take part in a range
OL,17,Fof outdoor activities.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
