OL,3,GNEWSANew charity uses outdoors to
OL,4,Aimprove mental health
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity said it wanted to gather
OL,7,Fresearch on what kind of support men
OL,8,Fare most likely to engage with, arguing
OL,9,Fthat services have often been designed
OL,10,Fwithout asking men first.
OL,12,FChief executive Kate Bergquist said it
OL,13,Fhad grown out of years of work in
OL,14,Fsocial care, public services and
OL,15,Foutdoor wellbeing programmes.
